  "description": {
   "en": "Ye Feng, the most mysterious legend of the Dragon Nation and the revered master of the Dragon God Hall, returns to Jiang City after five years. With unmatched power, he crushes corrupt elites, avenges his family, and protects his beloved wife. His wrath shakes the heavens, and his might commands the seas. The Dragon God returns—ready to dominate the world once more!",
   "zh": "龙国最神秘的传说，最强的那个男人，被尊称为“叶神”的龙神殿之主叶风，五年后重回江城。斗权贵，报家仇，护妻子。一怒而风云变色，一出手翻江倒海。龙神霸主，再战江湖！"
  },
